-- once the pool is full it meant projecting nearly every tracked zombie every frame:
-- measured at 94 of 94 projected, 17.8 ms a pass, 36% of the client spent continuously.
-- That was the largest single cost in the script, and the health guard could not touch
-- it because it only ever throttled sweeps - so under load the one dominant cost was
-- the one thing that never backed off.
local ZOMB_POOL    = 24
